<title>SPAIN: Spain CNMV recognised IBCA ratings for derivatives.</title>
<headline>Spain CNMV recognised IBCA ratings for derivatives.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA rating Espana, Spanish unit of the European credit rating, said on Tuesday the stock market commission CNMV recognised it as a specialised agency assigning ratings to counterparties of investment funds operating in OTC derivative instruments.</p>
<p>In a statement IBCA added the recognition by CNMV is in accordance with the new law allowing Spanish investment trust to trade in derivatives traded in over the counter market.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
</text>
